<title>BRAZIL: Brazil Telesp posts 11-month profit-report.</title>
<headline>Brazil Telesp posts 11-month profit-report.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian state telecoms firm Telesp, a unit of the federal Telebras system serving Sao Paulo state, has posted a preliminary net profit of 712.9 million reais ($685.5 million) for the first 11 months of 1996, Invest News said.</p>
<p>((--Simona de Logu, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 507 4151))</p>
